# Intentionally empty.
# The Dockerfile bind-mounts ./vllm at build time, so this directory must exist,
# but VLLM_SOURCE defaults to 'remote' and vLLM is cloned at the pinned commit
# 281955fc63c823e8a439db82bf02ad9fffb199e2. A missing ./vllm fails the build with
#   ERROR: failed to compute cache key: "/vllm": not found
